      "en": "If you forget to change the variable in the condition, the loop spins forever and the page or script freezes (examples here stop after 15 seconds). In automation always add a **maximum**: `let guard = 0; while (cond && guard++ < 1000)`. In n8n an endless loop can eat executions and bring the server down."
